{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1009111-homid-v-lupus-aging","id":1009111,"title":"Homid v Lupus Aging","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-27T18:36:22-08:00","id":1009111,"title":"Homid v Lupus Aging","content":"Working on a character concept, and I may have just missed it in the book (focusing more on reading up on Tribes and stuff). Do Homids and Lupines have a similar lifespan? What about reaching maturity? Thinking of going Lupus, not sure if he should be 20 or 2.<br /> <br /> Edit: Found it! In a sidebar, nowhere near the section on &quot;aging&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3075-coridan","name":"Coridan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T20:24:35-08:00","id":1009144,"title":"","content":"Glad you found it. The lupus character will still look about as old as a Homid character when in Homid form (so 14-20?).<br /> <br /> And Homids <i>should</i> have slightly longer lifespans than Lupus, but Garou rarely die of old age anyways. If they do get up there, they can generally live to be 90-120 I seem to remember. Though again, that really won't happen outside of a special NPC or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T21:39:13-08:00","id":1011841,"title":"","content":"Lifespans are actually pretty blurry for Garou. There are few accounts of aged werewolves, but they do exist and with some frequency seems to reach the &quot;obscenely, unknowable, old&quot;. It goes for any breed, with the Silver Fangs having one of those in Russia that is a Lupus, by the way.<br /> <br /> So don't think too much about age above adulthood. The distortions are too much for any prediction or statistic to be accurate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}